+        // [openbf2] The BF2 menu is played not by Flash Player but by
+        // SwiffPlayer — and that one is built on gameswf, where properties
+        // live in a `stringi_hash`, that is **case-insensitively**
+        // (reference/gameswf, gameswf_object.h:44). The movie relies on it:
+        // the active account's caption is set by a call to
+        // `profiletext.setvalue(...)` while the method is called `setValue`.
+        // By Adobe's rule (version 7 and up — case-sensitive) the call
+        // silently misses and "Label" stays on screen. We reproduce the
+        // original player, so we take its behaviour. docs/research/11-ruffle-menu.md.
+        false
